ngth:"2.2 miles",description:"A challenging climb that rewards hikers with a spectacular view of the 100-foot Rainbow Falls cascading over a rock face."}],campingInfo:"The park features 17 primitive walk-in campsites located along the river, accessible only by hiking in. No RV hookups are available.",wildlife:["Black bear","White-tailed deer","Wild turkey","Salamanders","Various songbirds"],visitorCenter:{name:"Jones Gap Ranger Station",info:"Provides trail maps, fishing information, and educational exhibits about the local ecosystem.",hours:"Daily: 9:00 AM - 5:00 PM",phone:"(864) 836-3647"},hours:"Daily: 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM (Extended to 9:00 PM during Daylight Savings)",address:"303 Jones Gap Rd, Marietta, SC 29661",googleMapsLocation:"https://maps.google.com/?q=Jones+Gap+State+Park+Marietta+SC",officialWebsite:"https://southcarolinaparks.com/jones-gap",bestTimeToVisit:"Spring for wildflowers and autumn for vibrant fall foliage.",tips:["Arrive early on weekends as the parking lot fills up quickly due to limited capacity.","Wear sturdy hiking boots as the trails are rocky and can be slippery near waterfalls.","Check the park website for trail closures before heading out, especially after heavy rain."],nearbyAttractions:["Caesars Head State Park","Table Rock State Park","Pretty Place Chapel","Travelers Rest"],entranceFees:"$6.00 for adults, $3.75 for SC seniors, $3.50 for children ages 6-15, and free for children 5 and under.",fishingBoating:"The Middle Saluda River is a designated State Scenic River and offers excellent trout fishing; a valid South Carolina fishing license is required."},{id:"edisto-beach-state-park",name:"Edisto Beach State Park",image:"https://kosher-travel-img.sites.tab.bot/venues/park-edisto-beach-state-park-south-carolina.webp",photoGallery:[],shortDescription:"Edisto Beach State Park offers a unique coastal experience featuring one of the longest networks of ADA-accessible hiking and biking trails in South Carolina.",fullDescription:"Located on 